This application uses an unmodified Ghostscript 10.08.0 binary and unmodified
MuPDF 1.28.1 JavaScript/WASM distribution. Their corresponding source archives
are provided alongside the native installers on the same GitHub release.
Application source and build instructions are supplied there too. The local
portable-folder builder also includes these files in its Sources directory.
Source and releases: https://github.com/theDutchmanJames/SlotForgeDecals

The interface follows the SlotForge application collection's visual direction.
The included car illustrations were generated for this application and are
generic illustrative references, not licensed manufacturer templates.
